# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without eol=lf, core.autocrlf on Windows checks out CRLF. gofmt then reports
# every Go file as unformatted locally, while the Linux CI `gofmt -l .` gate
# passes. Pinning LF keeps the local and CI formatting gates in agreement.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.exe binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
